    "title": "Herd advances to Fab 4 in WNIT - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jim Treacy ,\n2 days ago HUNTINGTON, W.Va. (WSAZ) - The Marshall women’s basketball team achieved a rare feat Monday night in the WNIT Great Eight as they held Army scoreless for the entire fourth quarter and won 82-65. The two teams traded buckets in the first half with the Black Knights shooting 60% from the floor while the Herd almost matching that number with 59%. Army led by seven after 20 minutes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
